<div class="bhd-page__keypoints" aria-label="Investor overview"><div><strong>In market</strong><span>A Canadian NHP hydration product is commercially available in Canada and the United States.</span></div><div><strong>Evidence building</strong><span>A 2026 peer-reviewed hydration review has been accepted in Frontiers in Nutrition, with further research in development.</span></div><div><strong>Pipeline expanding</strong><span>Best Hydrate is developing additional products, research programs and future clinical-development pathways.</span></div></div>

<section class="bhd-page__feature"><div><p class="bhd-page__kicker">The opportunity</p><h2>One hydration platform, built to compound value across markets</h2><p>Best Hydrate is designed to connect consumer demand, formulation, hydration science, product development and partnerships. Each layer can strengthen the others: market learning improves products, research sharpens decisions, and stronger evidence opens more demanding applications over time.</p></div></section>

<section class="bhd-page__cards-section"><p class="bhd-page__kicker">Platform</p><h2>Four hydration markets, one evidence discipline</h2><div class="bhd-page__cards bhd-page__cards--4"><article><h3>Performance</h3><p>Athletes, heat, sweat, endurance and recovery.</p></article><article><h3>Daily</h3><p>Everyday hydration, work, travel and active living.</p></article><article><h3>Medical</h3><p>Higher-evidence applications developed through appropriate research and regulatory pathways.</p></article><article><h3>Humanitarian</h3><p>Access and implementation opportunities developed with capable partners and appropriate safeguards.</p></article></div></section>

<section class="bhd-page__split"><div class="bhd-page__split-media"><img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/3183150/pexels-photo-3183150.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1500" alt="Business team discussing charts and next-stage priorities" width="1500" height="1000" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="bhd-page__split-copy"><p class="bhd-page__kicker">Current foundation</p><h2>Commercial presence and scientific development already underway</h2><ul><li>Best Hydrate Inc., founded in Alberta in 2021</li><li>Canadian Natural Health Product authorization, NPN 80118664</li><li>Commercial consumer hydration product available in Canada and the U.S.</li><li>2026 peer-reviewed Frontiers in Nutrition hydration review accepted August 27, 2026, with Best Hydrate affiliation</li><li>Additional research work in development</li><li>Broader product and clinical-development pipeline in progress</li></ul><p>Future research outcomes, channels and clinical applications remain subject to successful development, validation and regulatory requirements.</p></div></section>

<section class="bhd-page__cards-section"><p class="bhd-page__kicker">Next-stage priorities</p><h2>Where additional capital can accelerate progress</h2><div class="bhd-page__cards bhd-page__cards--4"><article><h3>Marketing</h3><p>Strengthen positioning, demand generation and customer acquisition.</p></article><article><h3>Sales & distribution</h3><p>Expand channels, repeatable sales systems and commercial reach.</p></article><article><h3>Research & product pipeline</h3><p>Advance planned research, study development and prioritized product work.</p></article><article><h3>Clinical readiness</h3><p>Build the evidence, partnerships and preparation required for future clinical-development work.</p></article></div></section>

<section class="bhd-page__prose-grid"><article class="bhd-page__prose"><p class="bhd-page__kicker">Seed strategy</p><h2>Disciplined capital for a defined next stage</h2><p>Best Hydrate is exploring a modest seed financing intended to accelerate execution without overcapitalizing the business ahead of its next proof points.</p><p>We are particularly interested in conversations with a prospective lead investor who can help shape a strong round, alongside a follow-on cohort of aligned investors and strategic supporters.</p></article><aside class="bhd-page__callout"><span class="bhd-page__callout-label">Connect</span><h3>Capital, advice and introductions are all valuable.</h3><p>Experienced investors, operators and connectors are invited to start a conversation.</p><a class="bhd-page__button" href="/pages/investor-contact#interest-form">Investor & Advisor Interest</a></aside></section>

